     3,
     "<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\"><div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">From:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">geomorph-...@googlegroups.com</a> &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">geomorph-...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt;\r\n<b>On Behalf Of </b>?????? ??????<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> Wednesday, April 22, 2020 4:36 AM<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> geomorph R package &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">geomorph-...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> [geomorph-r-package] Repeatability<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Hello Geomorph community,<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">I have a little question on Repeatability calculation :) <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">So, in my dataset are 277 specimens, each one was digitized twice (which means replicates=2). I want to compute repeatability value. Firstly, I read guide from Dr. Sherratt and then this disscusion in geomorph google group (<a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/m/#!topic/geomorph-r-package/Cj_CfXzJtrw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/m/%23!topic/geomorph-r-package/Cj_CfXzJtrw&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792484532287000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3lhu_Eqlu_zK-6or3fzDvI\">https://groups.google.com/forum/m/#!topic/geomorph-r-package/Cj_CfXzJtrw</a>).<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">I did a nested ANOVA:<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">id</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">=gl(2,277)          </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">geomorphdataframe=geomorph.data.frame(Shape=Shape,</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">+                                      \r\n<b>ind=id,</b></span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">+                                       indiv=Specimen_info$individual_names</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">+                                       rep=as.factor(Specimen_info$rep)</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">+ )</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">anv&lt;-procD.lm(Shape ~\r\n<b>ind</b>, data = geomorphdataframe, iter = 999)</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">summary(anv)</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">Analysis of Variance, using Residual Randomization</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">Permutation procedure: Randomization of null model residuals </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">Number of permutations: 1000 </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">Estimation method: Ordinary Least Squares </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">Sums of Squares and Cross-products: Type I </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">Effect sizes (Z) based on F distributions</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">           Df      SS       MS     Rsq      F      Z Pr(&gt;F)   </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">ind:rep    <b> 1</b> 0.03971 0.039707 0.02564 14.527 4.4738  0.001 **</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">Residuals <b>552</b> 1.50879 0.002733 0.97436                        </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">Total     <b>553 </b>\r\n1.54850                                         </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">---</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">Signif. codes:  0 ‘***’ 0.001 ‘**’ 0.01 ‘*’ 0.05 ‘.’ 0.1 ‘ ’ 1</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">Call: procD.lm(f1 = Shape ~ ind:rep, data = geomorphdataframe)</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">So, my Repeatability in this case is:<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">(MS(ind:rep) - MS(residuals)) / (MS(ind:rep) + MS(residuals))</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Can someone tell me if the formula is <b>correct</b> on <b>not</b>? :)<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Then I was surprised that all individuals are in resudials, so I decided to make procD.lm in a little different way:<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">geomorphdataframe=geomorph.data.frame(Shape=Shape,</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">+                                       ind=id,</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">+                                       <b>indiv=Specimen_info$individual_names</b></span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">+                                       rep=as.factor(Specimen_info$rep)</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">+ )</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">anv_indiv&lt;-procD.lm(Shape ~\r\n<b>indiv</b>, data = geomorphdataframe, iter = 999)</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">summary(anv_indiv)</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">Analysis of Variance, using Residual Randomization</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">Permutation procedure: Randomization of null model residuals </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">Number of permutations: 1000 </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">Estimation method: Ordinary Least Squares </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">Sums of Squares and Cross-products: Type I </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">Effect sizes (Z) based on F distributions</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">           Df     SS        MS     Rsq      F      Z Pr(&gt;F)   </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">indiv     <b>276</b> 1.3804 0.0050015 0.89144 8.2415 22.969  0.001 **</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">Residuals <b>277</b> 0.1681 0.0006069 0.10856                        </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">Total     <b>553</b> 1.5485                                          </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">---</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">Signif. codes:  0 ‘***’ 0.001 ‘**’ 0.01 ‘*’ 0.05 ‘.’ 0.1 ‘ ’ 1</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">Call: procD.lm(f1 = Shape ~ indiv, iter = 999, data = geomorphdataframe)</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">So, my Repeatability in this case is:<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">(MS(indiv) - MS(residuals)) / (MS(indiv) + MS(residuals))</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Can someone explaine to me which one <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">procD.lm\r\n</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">formula</span> is correct?<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Thank you in advance!<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Lyna<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div></div>"
